00:12:19.122 --> 00:12:20.723
So, thank you guys again for watching.

00:12:20.723 --> 00:12:21.880
I believe in you.

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:23.929
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:12:23.929 --> 00:12:26.468
and whatever your one word is.

00:12:26.468 --> 00:12:28.801
Much love, I'll see ya soon.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.859
- Self awareness is a critical
part of mental health.

00:12:38.859 --> 00:12:42.181
This is how you discover
why you react and respond

00:12:42.181 --> 00:12:45.801
the way you do to people
and situations around you.

00:12:45.801 --> 00:12:47.980
Successful people understand themselves

00:12:47.980 --> 00:12:50.383
and why they think and
feel the way they do,

00:12:50.383 --> 00:12:52.555
and that's one of the
things that you learn.

00:12:52.555 --> 00:12:55.296
When you can understand
and accept yourself,

00:12:55.296 --> 00:12:58.936
you can begin moving forward
in other areas of your life.

00:12:58.936 --> 00:13:01.575
Your level of ability in your field

00:13:01.575 --> 00:13:05.204
will determine the quality
and quantity of your results.

00:13:05.204 --> 00:13:07.221
The better you get at what you do,

00:13:07.221 --> 00:13:09.295
the easier is it for you to start

00:13:09.295 --> 00:13:14.024
moving forward and to get a
particular level of results.

00:13:14.024 --> 00:13:16.646
As you increase your
skill level in your field

00:13:16.646 --> 00:13:18.445
through study and experience,

00:13:18.445 --> 00:13:21.229
you get better and better
at doing the small things

00:13:21.229 --> 00:13:25.203
that increase the speed and
predictability of your results.

00:13:25.203 --> 00:13:28.208
Remember, skills are things
that can be developed

00:13:28.208 --> 00:13:31.942
over and over and all
business skills are learnable.

00:13:31.942 --> 00:13:34.904
You can learn any skill you need to learn

00:13:34.904 --> 00:13:38.254
to achieve any business goal
that you can set for yourself.

00:13:38.254 --> 00:13:41.006
Talk to yourself
positively about the person

00:13:41.006 --> 00:13:43.942
that you want to be and the
things that you want to have.

00:13:43.942 --> 00:13:45.279
When you see a beautiful car, you say,

00:13:45.279 --> 00:13:47.271
"I drive a car like that pretty soon."

00:13:47.271 --> 00:13:48.548
When you see beautiful clothes, you say,

00:13:48.548 --> 00:13:50.210
"Those are the kind of clothes I wear."

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:51.527
When you see beautiful homes, you say,

00:13:51.527 --> 00:13:53.027
"I'm going to live in a house like that."

00:13:53.027 --> 00:13:55.418
Just keep talking to yourself about

00:13:55.418 --> 00:13:56.682
the things that you want to have

00:13:56.682 --> 00:13:58.437
and the person that you want to be,

00:13:58.437 --> 00:14:00.820
and each time you do,
you're reprogramming.

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:03.916
And your subconscious mind is
accepting your new commands

00:14:03.916 --> 00:14:07.777
and is working 24 hours a day
to bring them into your life.

00:14:07.777 --> 00:14:10.566
Just give it a try and see what happens.

